	<section>
		<h1>02.2 / First Fighter form sheet — superseded</h1>
		<p>
			Preserved evidence, 30 October 2026. The forms felt too close to odd 1980s
			arcade silhouettes. Arrow and perhaps Clipped wings were close; Barbed
			arrow might contribute. No form was selected. The missing design direction
			is sleek turn-of-the-millennium vector art: clean forms, luminous
			surfaces, and controlled glow rather than line graphics. This is a study
			finding, not an adopted game-wide rule.
		</p>
